<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Equity Award Agreement</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif; margin: 40px; line-height: 1.6; }
    h1 { text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 18px; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .section { margin: 20px 0; }
    .label { font-weight: bold; display: inline-block; width: 150px; }
    .value { display: inline-block; }
    .signature-block { margin-top: 60px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
    .signature-box { width: 45%; }
    .signature-line { border-top: 1px solid #000; margin-top: 40px; padding-top: 5px; }
    table { width: 100%; margin: 20px 0; }
    th, td { padding: 8px; text-align: left; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <h1>Equity Award Agreement</h1>
  
  <div class="section">
    <p><strong>Company:</strong> {{company.legalName}}</p>
    <p><strong>Grant Date:</strong> {{grantDate}}</p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Participant Information</h2>
    <p><span class="label">Name:</span> <span class="value">{{officer.fullName}}</span></p>
    <p><span class="label">Title:</span> <span class="value">{{officer.title}}</span></p>
    <p><span class="label">Email:</span> <span class="value">{{officer.email}}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Award Details</h2>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0">
      <tr>
        <th>Award Type</th>
        <td>{{awardType}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>Shares Granted</th>
        <td>{{sharesGranted}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>Strike Price</th>
        <td>${{strikePrice}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>Vesting Schedule</th>
        <td>{{vestingSchedule}}</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <th>Cliff Period</th>
        <td>{{cliffPeriod}}</td>
      </tr>
    </table>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Terms and Conditions</h2>
    <p>This equity award is subject to the following terms:</p>
    <ol>
      <li>This award is granted under and subject to the {{company.legalName}} Equity Incentive Plan (the "Plan").</li>
      <li>Vesting is contingent upon continued service with the Company.</li>
      <li>Unvested equity shall be forfeited upon termination for cause or voluntary resignation.</li>
      <li>Upon change of control, vesting acceleration may apply as defined in the Plan.</li>
      <li>Participant acknowledges receipt and review of the Plan document.</li>
      <li>This award does not constitute a contract of employment or guarantee of continued service.</li>
    </ol>
  </div>

  <div class="section">
    <h2>Acknowledgment</h2>
    <p>By signing below, Participant acknowledges that they have read, understood, and agree to be bound by the terms of this Equity Award Agreement and the {{company.legalName}} Equity Incentive Plan.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <div class="signature-box">
      <p><strong>Company</strong></p>
      <p>{{company.legalName}}</p>
      <img src="https://xaxbucnjlrfkccsfiddq.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/brand-assets/torrance_stroman_signature.png"
           alt="Torrance Stroman Signature"
           style="height:60px;object-fit:contain;margin-top:16px;" />
      <p>Torrance A. Stroman, Chief Executive Officer</p>
      <p>Date: ______________________</p>
    </div>
    
    <div class="signature-box">
      <p><strong>Participant</strong></p>
      <p>{{officer.fullName}}</p>
      <div class="signature-line">
        <p><strong>Executive Signature</strong></p>
        <p>Date: ______________________</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>